<title>USA: Fidelity Investments makes fund manager change.</title>
<headline>Fidelity Investments makes fund manager change.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments on Friday said it named Erin Sullivan portfolio manager of its Emerging Growth Fund, effective April 14.</p>
<p>Sullivan succeeds John Hurley, who is leaving the company to pursue a new opportunity.</p>
<p>The firm said Sullivan will continue to manage Fidelity Select Software and Computer Services Portfolio, which she has managed since January 1997.</p>
